= Relations With the Army

Our contacts in the General Staff remain uneasy about the course of civilian politics. We could seek to reassure them behind closed doors, or make a public gesture of conciliation. Neither course would come without a political cost, particularly when our supporters expect us to resist military interference in Parliament.

- @connections: Approach our contacts in the General Staff privately.
- @statements: Make a public statement reassuring the armed forces.
- @decline: Maintain our position.
- @navigation_return_main: Return

@connections
choose-if: resources >= 2
subtitle: Requires substantial resources and concessions that may anger the party left.
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the resources needed for a sustained round of private talks.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commit(Q); Q.relations_with_the_army_available_time = Q.time + (Q.rubicon_mode ? 4 : 2); Q.coup_timer = Math.max(0, Q.coup_timer - 2); !} resources -= 2; left_kemalists_dissent += 3; kemalist_marxists_dissent += 3; month_actions += 1
go-to: post_event

Our intermediaries reassure senior officers that the CHP will defend the constitutional order. The conversations ease some of the tension, but news of our concessions spreads through the party, where the Left of the Center movement fears we have given the generals too much ground.

@statements
subtitle: May calm the officers, but disappoint our democratic base and deepen factional dissent.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commit(Q); Q.relations_with_the_army_available_time = Q.time + (Q.rubicon_mode ? 4 : 2); Q.coup_timer = Math.max(0, Q.coup_timer - 1); !} workers_chp -= 2; left_kemalists_dissent += 4; month_actions += 1
go-to: post_event

We publicly reaffirm the army's constitutional role while avoiding direct confrontation with its commanders. The conciliatory language offers some reassurance, but workers and party activists who looked to us for a firmer defense of civilian rule are disappointed.

@decline
subtitle: We will offer no new assurances to the generals this month.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commit(Q); Q.relations_with_the_army_available_time = Q.time + (Q.rubicon_mode ? 4 : 2); !} month_actions += 1
go-to: post_event

We refuse to make concessions merely to satisfy the military leadership.

